<title>USA: Respironics gets BiPAP Duet clearance.</title>
<headline>Respironics gets BiPAP Duet clearance.</headline>
<dateline>MURRYSVILLE, Pa. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Respironics Inc said on Wednesday that it has received 510(k) clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market its BiPAP Duet System in the United States.</p>
<p>The unit, which treats patients suffering from adult obstructive sleep apnea, has been available internationally since February 1996.</p>
